              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 34:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo byona ku byahweire, Abaisraeli boona abaabaire bari aho baaza omu ndembo za Yuda, baashenyagura enyomyo, baatemagura Ashera, baasheenya ebyombeko by'omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu n'amatambiro omuri Yuda yoona, omuri Benyamiini, Efuraimu na Manaase, okuhitsya obu baabicwekyereize byona. Batyo Abaisraeli boona baagaruka omu ndembo zaabo, buri muntu omu butaka bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
